ot in the ordinary course be considered as carrying on a business from a licensing perspective.  It is also not the SFC’s intent to extend its regulatory oversight to this type of single family office setup.\",\"unit_id\":\"daa1876316641.u40.28601\"}],\"distinction\":\"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] The antecedent is satisfied only when the arrangement is genuine, receives no income beyond reimbursement, and lacks a profit objective. This parses the negation as governing the coordinated business conditions together.\",\"family\":\"scope\",\"formalization\":{\"facts\":[{\"meaning\":\"The arrangement is a genuine single family office established to serve the investment needs of members of a single family.\",\"name\":\"genuine_family_arrangement\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"daa1876316641.u40.28601\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"truth value\"},{\"meaning\":\"The arrangement receives income other than reimbursement of operating expenses from the family.\",\"name\":\"income_beyond_reimbursement\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"daa1876316641.u40.28601\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"truth value\"},{\"meaning\":\"The arrangement has the pursuit of profit as its business objective.\",\"name\":\"profit_objective\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"daa1876316641.u40.28601\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"truth value\"}],\"result\":\"(and genuine_family_arrangement (not (or income_beyond_reimbursement profit_objective)))\",\"result_type\":\"bool\",\"scope\":\"true\"},\"local_id\":\"family-office.ordinary-course-antecedent.joint-negation\",\"questions\":[\"This stricter reading requires both operational indicators of business absence to be negative; the source wording does not resolve whether “or” is inside or outside the negation.\"],\"statement\":\"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Under this parse, the disputed antecedent is satisfied only when a genuine single family arrangement neither receives income beyond reimbursement nor has a profit ob